    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "BPF Architecture and Program Types",
      "source_hash": 8925307580793407473,
      "context_hash": 14714917768321064507,
      "translation": "BPF 아키텍처와 프로그램 유형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757471Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How eBPF programs are loaded, verified, and attached to kernel hooks",
      "source_hash": 14413086858527265178,
      "context_hash": 5439924588161022605,
      "translation": "eBPF 프로그램이 로드되고, 검증되고, 커널 훅에 연결되는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eBPF": "eBPF",
        "hook": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "From cBPF to eBPF",
      "source_hash": 6546222728431455616,
      "context_hash": 15866841577464201284,
      "translation": "cBPF에서 eBPF로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eBPF": "eBPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Classic BPF (1993–2014)",
      "source_hash": 13018440140347948986,
      "context_hash": 4399508875064618601,
      "translation": "Classic BPF (1993–2014)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "BPF was not originally a Linux invention.",
      "source_hash": 552650687827570979,
      "context_hash": 13625449660470778063,
      "translation": "BPF는 원래 Linux에서 만들어진 것이 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It came from a paper by Steven McCanne and Van Jacobson at Lawrence Berkeley Laboratory presented at USENIX Winter 1993: *\"The BSD Packet Filter: A New Architecture for User-level Packet Capture.\"* [(paper)](https://www.tcpdump.org/papers/bpf-usenix93.pdf)",
      "source_hash": 13768873464780198099,
      "context_hash": 16047586213138272078,
      "translation": "BPF는 Lawrence Berkeley Laboratory의 Steven McCanne과 Van Jacobson이 USENIX Winter 1993에서 발표한 논문 \"*The BSD Packet Filter: A New Architecture for User-level Packet Capture.*\"에서 비롯되었습니다. [(논문)](https://www.tcpdump.org/papers/bpf-usenix93.pdf)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The original BPF was a small virtual machine with two 32-bit registers (`A` and `X`), a small scratch memory array, and a simple instruction set designed for one purpose: filtering network packets in the kernel before copying them to userspace.",
      "source_hash": 9267067613636712132,
      "context_hash": 12613645516865950785,
      "translation": "최초의 BPF는 32비트 레지스터 두 개(`A`와 `X`), 작은 스크래치 메모리 배열, 그리고 단 하나의 목적을 위해 설계된 단순한 명령어 집합을 갖춘 작은 가상 머신이었습니다. 그 목적은 네트워크 패킷을 사용자 공간으로 복사하기 전에 커널 안에서 필터링하는 것이었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "array": "배열",
        "bit": "비트",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Linux adopted it as `SO_ATTACH_FILTER` — attach a filter to a socket to drop packets you don't care about before they reach `recvmsg()`.",
      "source_hash": 13876155813525256484,
      "context_hash": 11590376680283249457,
      "translation": "Linux는 이를 `SO_ATTACH_FILTER`로 도입했습니다. 소켓에 필터를 연결하여 관심 없는 패킷이 `recvmsg()`에 도달하기 전에 버리는 방식입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "That was its entire purpose.",
      "source_hash": 10725540057528439648,
      "context_hash": 1533644894343333157,
      "translation": "그것이 BPF의 목적의 전부였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "The implementation lived almost entirely in `net/core/filter.c`.",
      "source_hash": 9108298143517246635,
      "context_hash": 7988804203296072962,
      "translation": "구현은 거의 전부 `net/core/filter.c`에 들어 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem with cBPF",
      "source_hash": 13732973215974437003,
      "context_hash": 17978762355273438829,
      "translation": "cBPF의 문제점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "As Linux kernel development accelerated in the 2000s and 2010s, multiple subsystems needed a way to let userspace express policies in the kernel without giving userspace arbitrary kernel code execution:",
      "source_hash": 3619990662863065002,
      "context_hash": 14909491010781977753,
      "translation": "2000년대와 2010년대에 Linux 커널 개발이 가속화되면서, 여러 서브시스템에서 사용자 공간에 임의의 커널 코드 실행 권한을 주지 않고도 사용자 공간이 커널 안에서 정책을 표현할 수 있는 방법이 필요해졌습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**seccomp** (2005): wanted to filter system calls.",
      "source_hash": 6691725038561102130,
      "context_hash": 11305218452750442504,
      "translation": "**seccomp** (2005): 시스템 콜을 필터링하고자 했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seccomp": "seccomp",
        "system call": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Used cBPF as-is, but the 2-register model was awkward for real policies.",
      "source_hash": 14514083722323254514,
      "context_hash": 1929396612847974084,
      "translation": "cBPF를 그대로 사용했지만, 레지스터 2개 모델은 실제 정책을 표현하기에 불편했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "policies": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**tc** (traffic control): needed programmable packet classification and mangling, not just filtering.",
      "source_hash": 8412550406446228316,
      "context_hash": 11904913561165714586,
      "translation": "**tc** (traffic control): 단순한 필터링이 아니라 프로그래밍 가능한 패킷 분류와 변경(mangling)이 필요했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**perf/tracing**: wanted to attach custom aggregation logic to probe points to avoid copying raw events to userspace.",
      "source_hash": 10928667863761150113,
      "context_hash": 6667959329262773539,
      "translation": "**perf/트레이싱**: 원시 이벤트를 사용자 공간으로 복사하지 않도록 프로브 지점에 사용자 정의 집계 로직을 연결하고자 했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "perf": "perf",
        "tracing": "트레이싱",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:26:36.989413Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel modules could do all this, but they're dangerous: a buggy module panics the kernel, they require CAP_SYS_MODULE, and they're tied to a specific kernel version.",
      "source_hash": 5471268595754697720,
      "context_hash": 5923138424670114081,
      "translation": "커널 모듈로도 이 모든 것을 할 수 있었지만, 커널 모듈은 위험합니다. 버그가 있는 모듈은 커널 패닉을 일으키고, CAP_SYS_MODULE이 필요하며, 특정 커널 버전에 묶여 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel module": "커널 모듈",
        "kernel version": "커널 버전",
        "panic": "패닉"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "There was no way to safely run \"untrusted\" kernel code.",
      "source_hash": 72161446648269065,
      "context_hash": 797365016359873926,
      "translation": "\"신뢰할 수 없는\" 커널 코드를 안전하게 실행할 방법이 없었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "eBPF (Linux 3.18, 2014)",
      "source_hash": 14513488479993869137,
      "context_hash": 14147419635609514956,
      "translation": "eBPF (Linux 3.18, 2014)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "eBPF": "eBPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Alexei Starovoitov and Daniel Borkmann rewrote the BPF virtual machine from scratch.",
      "source_hash": 3922301945543008733,
      "context_hash": 15461530528558697335,
      "translation": "Alexei Starovoitov와 Daniel Borkmann이 BPF 가상 머신을 처음부터 다시 작성했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "The new design — retroactively called eBPF (extended BPF) [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/99c55f7d47c0dc6fc64729f37bf435abf43f4c60) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/603983/) — kept backward compatibility with cBPF socket filters (they are auto-translated) but was otherwise a new architecture:",
      "source_hash": 17611651713307712522,
      "context_hash": 10227511506994870133,
      "translation": "나중에 eBPF(extended BPF)라고 불리게 된 새 설계는 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/99c55f7d47c0dc6fc64729f37bf435abf43f4c60) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/603983/) cBPF 소켓 필터와의 하위 호환성을 유지했지만(cBPF 필터는 자동으로 변환됩니다), 그 밖의 면에서는 새로운 아키텍처였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "BPF": "BPF",
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "eBPF": "eBPF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:54:18.757474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
